 "scope": "The loop is closed on PERCEPTION, not on INTERACTION: nothing in the scene responds to the ego (actors are replayed or absent), there is no map and no drivable-area polygon, and the vehicle model has no collision response. This measures HOW WELL THE MODEL DRIVES ITSELF; it cannot measure WHAT HAPPENS WHEN IT DRIVES BADLY, and it cannot say 'safe'. n = 2 scenes; clusters are disjoint rollout starts of ONE clip each, not independent episodes. WITHIN-SIM RELATIVE: absolute levels do not transfer to real footage (REF-C open-loop ADE 1.5157 on these reconstructions vs 0.4728 on real footage, 3.21x OOD) -- orderings and paired differences may.",
